# Template for the live broker ACL. scripts/provision-mosquitto.sh fills in
# __INSTANCE_ID__ and writes /opt/freedriver-secrets/mosquitto/acl, which
# replaces the whole previous ACL (including leftover freedriver/v1/home/...
# rules) in one write. The live ACL exists on the VPS.
#
# Instance users keep exact appliances, commands, and metrics topics.
# user api uses + so a newly provisioned house is heard without an ACL edit.
#
# instanceId is the UUID the house mints (hex digits and hyphens, any UUID
# version). kaze hands the house-minted id to Techops, who runs:
#   INSTANCE_ID=<house-minted-uuid> ./scripts/provision-mosquitto.sh
#
# v1 serves houses with the broker users autonomy and api. Autonomy writes
# freedriver/v1/<instanceId>/metrics/#. api reads
# freedriver/v1/+/appliances, writes freedriver/v1/+/commands, and reads
# freedriver/v1/+/metrics/#. House users receive exact instance topics. Each
# later instance gets its own autonomy user.
#
# Publishers set retain=false on appliances and commands and publish with QoS 1.

user autonomy
topic write freedriver/v1/__INSTANCE_ID__/appliances
topic read freedriver/v1/__INSTANCE_ID__/commands
topic write freedriver/v1/__INSTANCE_ID__/metrics/#

user api
topic read freedriver/v1/+/appliances
topic write freedriver/v1/+/commands
topic read freedriver/v1/+/metrics/#
